=== PHASE G — THE GRID every family and the judge now use ===
    core 9 : rise {h-10, h, h+10} x plant {(0.120, x1.0), (0.130, x0.7), (0.125, x1.3)}   [round 3, unchanged]
    +2     : rise {h-5, h+5} at the nominal plant (0.120, x1.0)
    +3     : rise {h-10, h, h+10} at the slippery plant (drop 0.14, friction x0.5)
    N = 14. objective = meanReward(N) + 4*kStable(N) + 4*meanUprightCredit(N)
    a clear counts toward kStable only at >= 45 of 50 tail ticks upright.
    uprightCredit is uprightTailFrac in cells where the duck reached the flight (trunk past x=0.12
    at some tick, or a foot on a tread at some tick) and 0 otherwise, so standing still pays nothing.

